      "title": {
        "ja": "PostgreSQL フレキシブル サーバーを VNet 統合からプライベート エンドポイント対応へ変更可能に（GA）",
        "subtitleJa": "既存サーバーを Private Link 経由のプライベート IP アクセス構成へ。バックアップは保持されます",
        "en": "Generally Available: Change from virtual network integration to a private endpoint capable network configuration in Azure Database for PostgreSQL flexible server"
      },
      "meta": {
        "publishedJst": "2026-11-03",
        "availability": [{ "rawRing": "General Availability", "year": 2026, "month": "November" }],
        "status": "Launched",
        "products": ["Azure Database for PostgreSQL"],
        "categories": ["databases", "ops-governance"],
        "importance": "notable"
      },
      "audience": {
        "who": { "text": "委任サブネットで **VNet 統合の PostgreSQL フレキシブル サーバー**を運用している方", "origin": "mrc", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "source-only" },
        "change": { "text": "既存サーバーのままネットワーク設計の柔軟性を高められる", "origin": "mrc", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "source-only" },
        "changeNature": "benefit"
      },
      "action": {
        "required": "optional",
        "summary": { "text": "変更は元に戻せず接続が中断するため、実施するなら計画的に", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/postgresql/network/how-to-migrate-vnet-private-endpoint-capable-server", "locator": "ネットワーク構成を変更する手順", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z" }] }
      },
      "beforeAfter": {
        "before": {
          "text": "VNet 統合では、サーバーは仮想ネットワーク内の委任されたサブネットに配置される",
          "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
          "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/postgresql/network/how-to-migrate-vnet-private-endpoint-capable-server", "locator": "冒頭", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z" }]
        },
        "after": {
          "text": "プライベート エンドポイント対応の構成に変更し、Private Link 経由でプライベート IP アドレスからアクセスできる。既存のバックアップは保持される",
          "origin": "mrc", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "source-only"
        }
      },
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": "how-it-works", "heading": "仕組み", "availability": "present", "priority": "core",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "VNet 統合を、プライベート エンドポイントをサポートする構成に置き換える",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/postgresql/network/how-to-migrate-vnet-private-endpoint-capable-server", "locator": "冒頭", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "変更後はパブリック アクセスが既定で無効になる",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/postgresql/network/how-to-migrate-vnet-private-endpoint-capable-server", "locator": "パブリック アクセスの設定", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "how-to-start", "heading": "設定の流れ", "availability": "present", "priority": "core",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "ポータル: [ネットワーク] → 接続方法で「パブリック アクセス（許可された IP アドレス）とプライベート エンドポイント」を選び保存",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/postgresql/network/how-to-migrate-vnet-private-endpoint-capable-server", "locator": "ポータル", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "CLI: az postgres flexible-server migrate-network を実行",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/postgresql/network/how-to-migrate-vnet-private-endpoint-capable-server", "locator": "CLI", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "完了後、プライベート エンドポイントを追加するかファイアウォール規則を設定して接続を復元",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/postgresql/network/how-to-migrate-vnet-private-endpoint-capable-server", "locator": "接続を復元する", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "prerequisites-limits", "heading": "前提・制限", "availability": "present", "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "元に戻せない（VNet 統合には戻せない）。通常は最大 20 分、うち最大 10 分は接続不可",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/postgresql/network/how-to-migrate-vnet-private-endpoint-capable-server", "locator": "事前に知っておくべき詳細", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "論理レプリケーションのパブリッシャーは、サブスクライバーが接続できなくなる場合がある",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/postgresql/network/how-to-migrate-vnet-private-endpoint-capable-server", "locator": "論理レプリケーション", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "related-features", "heading": "似た機能との違い", "availability": "present", "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "VNet 統合は委任サブネットに配置、Private Link はプライベート エンドポイントで接続。後者が VNet 統合の代わりに推奨",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/postgresql/network/concepts-networking-private-link", "locator": "冒頭", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "use-case", "heading": "使いどころ・注意", "availability": "present", "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Terraform 管理なら delegated_subnet_id を削除しないとサーバーの置き換えが計画される",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/postgresql/network/how-to-migrate-vnet-private-endpoint-capable-server", "locator": "Terraform スクリプトを更新する", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z" }]
            },
            { "text": "業務時間外に実施し、接続元の切り替え手順を事前に用意する", "origin": "editorial", "assertion": "recommendation", "verification": "unverified" }
          ]
        }
      ],
